as otherwise provided by this Agreement, the conveyance of Parcel Ato the City shall include all
improvements located thereon and allright, title andinterest of the Grogan s in and tothe adjacent
streets and alleys, and the conveyance of Parcel B to the Grogans shall include all improvements
located thereon and the interest of the City in adjacent streets, alleys, and public rights-of-way,
provided, however, that the land exchange provided for in this Agreement shall not have the effect
of vacating any public rights-of-way or any easements of record.
SECTIONONE.TERMS OF LAND EXCHANGE AND OTHER CONSIDERATION:
(A)The City desires to acquire Parcel A from the Grogans to be used as an outfall area
