Fifty Dollars ($34,950.00)for Parcel A, the sum of Six Thousand Fifty Dollars ($6,050.00)for the
temporary construction easement, the sum of Fifteen Thousand Dollars ($15,00o.00) for the
permanent easement, and will convey Parcel B to the Grogans. The locations and areas of the
entitled“Snyder Storm Sewer, Exhibit B,”whichis attached to this Agreement and incorporated
here in by reference.
(B)At closing, the City will issue a check, drawn on funds in the hands of the City
Treasurer, in the amount of Fifty-Six Thousand Dollars ($56,000.00), which includes payment of
the purchase price of Thirty-Four Thousand Nine Hundred Fifty Dollars($34,950.00)for Parcel A,
payment in the amount of Six Thousand Fifty Dollars ($6,050.00)for the temporary construction
